/* Broken case: a Liberty file Yosys must reject (Option 2 handout 9.1). The function attribute of
   pin Y is missing its terminating ";". Yosys 0.33 and 0.70 both refuse it, with and without -lib.
   (An unbalanced brace was tried first, but Yosys 0.33 accepts that.) Do not edit (AGENTS.md). */
library (broken) {
  cell (bad_cell) {
    area : 1;
    pin (A) { direction : input; }
    pin (Y) { direction : output; function : "!A" }
  }
}
